            "question_1": "What does “Ready To Ship” mean?",
            "answer_1": "<p>Ready To Ship jewelry includes pieces that are already crafted and available in stock. These items do not require manufacturing time and can be dispatched quickly.</p>",
            "question_2": "How long does delivery take?",
            "answer_2": "<p>Ready To Ship orders are delivered within <strong>8–9 business days</strong> after dispatch, depending on your location.</p>",
            "question_3": "Can a Ready To Ship ring be resized?",
            "answer_3": "<p>Yes, limited resizing of <strong>up to one size up or down</strong> may be possible. However, this depends on the ring design.<br/><br/>Please contact us to verify before placing your order at <a href=\"mailto:support@crownmoissanite.com\"><strong>support@crownmoissanite.com</strong></a></p>",
            "question_4": "Can Ready To Ship items be customized?",
            "answer_4": "<p>No, these items cannot be customized as they are already made and prepared for immediate shipping.</p>",
            "question_5": "Are Ready To Ship items brand new?",
            "answer_5": "<p>Yes, all Ready To Ship pieces are brand new, unused, and quality-checked before shipping.</p>",
            "question_6": "Is the quality the same as made-to-order jewelry?",
            "answer_6": "<p>Yes, Ready To Ship jewelry follows the same quality standards and craftsmanship as our made-to-order pieces.</p>",
            "question_7": "What if the size doesn’t fit?",
            "answer_7": "<p>If the size doesn’t fit, please contact our support team after delivery and we’ll assist you with available options.</p>",
            "question_8": "Are Ready To Ship items limited in stock?",
            "answer_8": "<p>Yes, Ready To Ship items are available in limited quantities and are sold on a first-come, first-served basis.</p>",
            "question_9": "How do I care for my product?",
            "answer_9": "<p>Care instructions are included with each product. Generally, we recommend gentle cleaning and proper storage to maintain quality.</p>",
            "question_10": "Will I receive tracking details for my order?",
            "answer_10": "<p>Yes, once your Ready To Ship order is dispatched, you will receive tracking details via email.</p>",
